'''Nebula''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Nebula Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.

== Appearance ==
It has a thin, yet long golden blade with a purple nebula aura around it, hence the name. Its guard is made up of six golden quillons, two of them wrapping around the heel of the blade. All of the quillons are attached to the tiny purple gemstone in the center of the guard. It has a thin brown handle with a golden pommel that has a tiny purple gemstone placed in it.

== Trivia ==
* It is thought that Nebula is a cross between [[Gemstone]] and an [[Eternal]] knife.
*It was [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] icon for a period of time.
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

